Scoped swapuv chroma plane swap

The pixel-format selection and the plane exchange in src/video-ops/swapuv.ts
follow libavfilter/vf_swapuv.c (is_planar_yuv, query_formats, do_swap,
filter_frame, get_video_buffer).
